# Third-Party Notices

This project embeds a curated set of programming exercises in the compiled binary.
The exercise content is **not** vendored into this repository; it is fetched at build
time from the upstream repositories below (pinned to specific commits) and pruned
according to `exercises.manifest.yaml`. The resolved commits and per-file hashes are
recorded in `exercises.lock.yaml`.

